## Key Concepts
- React Native native modules and EventEmitter
- useEffect cleanup and AppState handling
- Minimal backpressure and memory safety trade-offs

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: JS side
function useHeartbeatStream() {
  const [beatTs, setBeatTs] = React.useState(null);
  React.useEffect(() => {
    const sub = HeartbeatBridge.addListener('beat', (ts) => setBeatTs(ts));
    HeartbeatBridge.startHeartbeat({ intervalMs: 500 });
    return () => { sub.remove(); HeartbeatBridge.stopHeartbeat(); };
